    '@type': 'Question',
    name: 'Which hosts run signed exact-ref models in Traverse?',
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: 'Discover → execute → trace. One shared runtime.wasm; embedders are clients. As of Traverse v0.15.0, published exact-ref execute is native Rust, traverse-embedder-web@0.15.0, Swift ExactModelHost on swift-host-v0.15.0, Kotlin ExactModelHost in Maven Central com.traverse-framework:traverse-embedder 0.15.0, and .NET ExactModelHost in nuget.org TraverseEmbedder 0.15.0. Every host enforces model_usage. Apple hosts can opt in to a signed Core ML variant; default placement stays wasm-cpu. Governed-path iPhone evidence is traverse#1630, still open. digits-mlp-1.0.0 uses a test-only key; production custody is #1567. No host is Certified.',
    },
  }],
});

const relatedLinks = [
